-- pre-epoch
1000-01-01 00:00:00.000
-- post-epoch
3000-01-01 00:00:00.000
-- documented upper bound at precision 7
9999-12-31 23:59:59.9999999
-- past upper bound at precision 7 (errs)
-- subsecond precision near the Unix epoch
1970-01-01 00:00:20.5555555
-- subsecond precision for a regular timestamp
2024-06-15 12:34:56.123456
-- legacy whole-seconds file (written as DateTime64(0) ticks == Unix seconds)
-- legacy read without setting interprets seconds as ticks (previously incorrect behavior)
1970-01-19 06:17:16.800
-- legacy read with setting restores the Unix-second instant
2020-01-01 00:00:00.000
